[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824892879","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3824892879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":3824892879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j-zvP","user":{"login":"dragonforge-dev","id":172682465,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkrs4Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172682465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/dragonforge-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T17:41:43Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T17:41:43Z","body":"So I did some research and saw that another issue #107311 might be related, as I have code in both these projects (_the other is a game that uses the above linked plugin_). Specifically, in `plugin.gd` script, I am loading a `.tres` file that contains a bus layout. This was a result of what I learned from @dalexeev in issue #104801.\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorPlugin\n\nconst AUTOLOAD_SOUND = \"Sound\"\nconst AUTOLOAD_MUSIC = \"Music\"\nconst RESOURCE = \"Resource\"\nconst ALBUM = \"Album\"\nconst SONG = \"Song\"\nconst SFX_PROJECT = \"SFXProject\"\nconst SOUND_EFFECT = \"SoundEffect\"\n\n\nfunc _enable_plugin() -> void:\n\tadd_autoload_singleton(AUTOLOAD_SOUND, \"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/sound.tscn\")\n\tadd_autoload_singleton(AUTOLOAD_MUSIC, \"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/music.tscn\")\n\tadd_custom_type(ALBUM, RESOURCE, preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/album.gd\"), preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/assets/icons/album.png\"))\n\tadd_custom_type(SONG, RESOURCE, preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/song.gd\"), preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/assets/icons/song.svg\"))\n\tadd_custom_type(SFX_PROJECT, RESOURCE, preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/sfx_project.gd\"), preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/assets/icons/crate.svg\"))\n\tadd_custom_type(SOUND_EFFECT, RESOURCE, preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/sound_effect.gd\"), preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/assets/icons/sound-effect.svg\"))\n\tProjectSettings.set_setting(\n\t\t\"audio/buses/default_bus_layout\",\n\t\t\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/sound_component_bus_layout.tres\",\n\t)\n\tProjectSettings.save()\n\tprint_rich(\"[color=yellow][b]WARNING[/b][/color]: Project must be reloaded for Audio Bus changes to appear. [color=ivory][b]Project -> Reload Current Project[/b][/color]\")\n\n\nfunc _disable_plugin() -> void:\n\tremove_autoload_singleton(AUTOLOAD_MUSIC)\n\tremove_autoload_singleton(AUTOLOAD_SOUND)\n\tremove_custom_type(ALBUM)\n\tremove_custom_type(SONG)\n\tremove_custom_type(SFX_PROJECT)\n\tremove_custom_type(SOUND_EFFECT)\n\tProjectSettings.set_setting(\n\t\t\"audio/buses/default_bus_layout\",\n\t\t\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/default_audio_bus_layout.tres\",\n\t)\n\tProjectSettings.save()\n\tprint_rich(\"[color=yellow][b]WARNING[/b][/color]: Project must be reloaded for Audio Bus changes to be removed. [color=ivory][b]Project -> Reload Current Project[/b][/color]\")\n```\n\nTaking that knowledge, I turned **Convert Text Resources to Binary** off.\n\n<img width=\"1192\" height=\"725\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b3cdc9b-48b8-4439-b3f3-b6036bc25c84\" />\n\nI then exported the project. The **memory access out of bounds** error went away. However, the only audio bus that worked was **Master**. Anything going through another audio bus just didn't work.\n\nSo, I created a [Sound Test MRP](https://github.com/dragonforge-dev/sound-test) in Godot 4.6.stable. All it has is two music files and two buttons. I manually added a **Music** bus. One button plays a song through the **Master** bus. The other plays music through the **Music** bus. In this project, the other bus works.\n\nThis correlates with something that I noticed which changed in 4.5.1. Which is in web exports, all my audio buses stopped working. Using 4.4.1, I made a game jam game, [Eternal Echoes](https://dragonforge-development.itch.io/eternal-echoes) which had many buses. They all worked. I used the same **Sound** plugin, but I created the game in the month of August and published it in September of 2025. August 20th, after I had manually created the Audio buses for Eternal Echoes, I got tired of doing so and added the code. ([Git Blame here.](https://github.com/dragonforge-dev/dragonforge-sound/blame/main/addons/dragonforge_sound/plugin.gd))\n\n**Eternal Echoes Sound Bus:**\n<img width=\"1225\" height=\"400\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef40232c-db0e-4f74-b3c1-875030bd4d19\" />\n\nLooking at the bus layout in the Eternal Echoes project, it seems clear I edited the default bus. Checking the code inside the plugin makes that clear:\n\n```gd\n@tool\nextends EditorPlugin\n\nconst AUTOLOAD_SOUND = \"Sound\"\nconst AUTOLOAD_MUSIC = \"Music\"\nconst RESOURCE = \"Resource\"\nconst ALBUM = \"Album\"\nconst SONG = \"Song\"\nconst SFX_PROJECT = \"SFXProject\"\nconst SOUND_EFFECT = \"SoundEffect\"\n\n\nfunc _enable_plugin() -> void:\n\tadd_autoload_singleton(AUTOLOAD_SOUND, \"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/sound.tscn\")\n\tadd_autoload_singleton(AUTOLOAD_MUSIC, \"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/music.tscn\")\n\tadd_custom_type(ALBUM, RESOURCE, preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/album.gd\"), preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/assets/icons/album.png\"))\n\tadd_custom_type(SONG, RESOURCE, preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/song.gd\"), preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/assets/icons/song.svg\"))\n\tadd_custom_type(SFX_PROJECT, RESOURCE, preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/sfx_project.gd\"), preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/assets/icons/crate.svg\"))\n\tadd_custom_type(SOUND_EFFECT, RESOURCE, preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/resources/sound_effect.gd\"), preload(\"res://addons/dragonforge_sound/assets/icons/sound-effect.svg\"))\n\n\nfunc _disable_plugin() -> void:\n\tremove_autoload_singleton(AUTOLOAD_MUSIC)\n\tremove_autoload_singleton(AUTOLOAD_SOUND)\n\tremove_custom_type(ALBUM)\n\tremove_custom_type(SONG)\n\tremove_custom_type(SFX_PROJECT)\n\tremove_custom_type(SOUND_EFFECT)\n```\n\nSo it seems that not loading a custom bus layout in the plugin is a workaround to this issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824892879/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3825665123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3825665123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":3825665123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kBwRj","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T20:46:49Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T20:46:49Z","body":"I'm able to reproduce the issue, started on 4.6 beta 3. Also, i was unable to reproduce compiling with `dev_build=yes` but with `production=yes` i could reproduce the bug. I'll bisect.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3825665123/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3826821791","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3826821791","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":3826821791,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kGKqf","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T00:40:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T00:40:41Z","body":"Reverting PR #110422 fixed the issue on my side. My bisect failed and after that i noticed compiling with MSVC `production=yes` reproduce the bug even in 4.6 beta 2. So i compiled with MinGW with `production=yes` and wasn't able to reproduce in 4.6 beta 2. \n\nI tried to revert the mentioned pr before bisect but as mentioned above the MSVC has something that keep reproducing the bug even before beta 3, but compiling with MinGW and `production=yes` i was able to reproduce in #110422 and fix reverting it. In both MSVC and MinGW im unable to reproduce the bug using `dev_build=yes` instead `production=yes`.\n\nCC @KoBeWi ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3826821791/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3826835937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3826835937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":3826835937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kGOHh","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T00:42:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T00:42:44Z","body":"That PR only changed editor code, it should not affect exported game.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3826835937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3827118829","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3827118829","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":3827118829,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kHTLt","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T01:26:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T01:26:28Z","body":"That's strange because reverting the PR worked on my end, no idea why.\n\n<img width=\"1086\" height=\"772\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d16adfae-2d74-47a1-946d-02b42efee375\" />\n\n<img width=\"1082\" height=\"746\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e92c069-ffdf-4c9c-b4a2-242ba60b6e65\" />\n\n<img width=\"765\" height=\"156\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2421e96e-25c9-4f17-9eb3-a3dd818ec826\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3827118829/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3827981231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3827981231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":3827981231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kKluv","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-31T09:22:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-31T09:22:28Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3824892879 does point out a link with audio buses so this editor only PR must have an impact on the project files and/or what gets exported.\n\nI'd suggest checking git diff of the project, and diffing zip exports,","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3827981231/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3834738108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3834738108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":3834738108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kkXW8","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T12:07:09Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T12:07:09Z","body":"I took some time yesterday to test more the issue and i have different results with different browsers and from using debug or releasee exports, here's the result (all tests was done using official executables/templates):\n\n<img width=\"1804\" height=\"641\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e05ec5d-5db1-41c3-bf39-dd5c76ec5705\" />\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\nDuring the tests i was able to get backtrace from latest master in Edge using a release export template with `dev_build=yes` but in Chrome and Firefox just worked without issues\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1079\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c9f6ea8-cb92-462d-88c6-ac58f6bc8f33\" />\n\n```\nGodot Engine v4.7.dev.custom_build.98782b6c8 (2026-01-31 21:56:49 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\ndragonforge-sound.js:14427 OpenGL API OpenGL ES 3.0 (WebGL 2.0 (OpenGL ES 3.0 Chromium)) - Compatibility - Using Device: WebKit - WebKit WebGL\ndragonforge-sound.html:153  RuntimeError: memory access out of bounds\n    at godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm.AudioServer::get_bus_index(StringName const&) const (wasm://wasm/godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm-5c318662)\n    at godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm.AudioDriverWeb::set_sample_bus_send(int, StringName const&) (wasm://wasm/godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm-5c318662)\n    at godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm.AudioServer::set_bus_layout(Ref<AudioBusLayout> const&) (wasm://wasm/godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm-5c318662)\n    at godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm.AudioServer::load_default_bus_layout() (wasm://wasm/godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm-5c318662)\n    at godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm.Main::setup2(bool) (wasm://wasm/godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm-5c318662)\n    at godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm.Main::setup(char const*, int, char**, bool) (wasm://wasm/godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm-5c318662)\n    at godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm.godot_web_main(int, char**) (wasm://wasm/godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm-5c318662)\n    at godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm.main (godot.web.template_release.dev.wasm32.nothreads.wasm-5c318662:0x78326)\n    at dragonforge-sound.js:579:12\n    at Object.callMain (dragonforge-sound.js:13790:15)\n```\n\n<br>\n\n-----\n\n<br>\n\n\n> [#115560 (comment)](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3824892879) does point out a link with audio buses so this editor only PR must have an impact on the project files and/or what gets exported.\n> \n> I'd suggest checking git diff of the project, and diffing zip exports,\n\nI redid this test using release templates with `dev_build=yes` in other browsers (my first test was only with Firefox) and while reverting works on Firefox the crash still on Edge and Chrome\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1079\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/02317f51-7f4a-4382-932c-c754277ba383\" />\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\nThere the exported version used for this test:\n\n[PR 110422 revert.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25010224/PR.110422.revert.zip)\n[PR 110422.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25010225/PR.110422.zip)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3834738108/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3835115947","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3835115947","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":3835115947,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7klzmr","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T13:26:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T13:26:48Z","body":"That test matrix is super weird, I don't see much pattern between the various Godot versions and browsers, aside from the fact that there's been some breakage since around dev3.\n\nSounds like it's non deterministic so maybe some UB / uninitialized memory?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/38351