s://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T19:13:08Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T19:13:08Z","body":"@Repiteo I'll take a look later today.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4557857302/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4586614529","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-4586614529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":4586614529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEWIvAQ","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-31T11:57:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-31T22:25:17Z","body":"I tested this issue again, but this time i also used `use_assertions=yes` and `use_safe_heap=yes` from Emscripten to compile the export templates and both in latest master dff2b9bb6 and 4.5 stable the project crashed with the same backtrace as the first tests:\n\n<img width=\"1913\" height=\"899\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca408df7-5632-4510-869e-a78264cef56a\" />\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b96318d8-9ce8-4a7e-bbcf-e97ce03bf2ae\" />\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n\nMy theory is the crash happens because the `buses.resize(p_bus_layout->buses.size());` call is filling the vector with dangling pointers. \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/dff2b9bb66a01d8c1a207531b0752405c7399124/servers/audio/audio_server.cpp#L1754-L1776\n\nAfter the resize, a loop starts to fill the vector again with the new buses. The first loop skips the `AudioDriver::get_singleton()->set_sample_bus_send` call as the first bus always the Master bus, Master bus is added to the buses vector and starts the second loop, this time `AudioDriver::get_singleton()->set_sample_bus_send` will be called with ends on `AudioServer::get_bus_index`\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/dff2b9bb66a01d8c1a207531b0752405c7399124/servers/audio/audio_server.cpp#L1008-L1015\n\nAt this point, `buses` have the Master bus at index 0 and whatever `buses.resize()` created on the others indexs and this call is done with `p_bus_name` as an empty `StringName`, so will not match with the Master bus on the first loop. Now is when the crash happens, any interaction with the other buses crashes the engine.\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\nI was able to fix the crash on two ways:\n\n- Calling `buses.fill(nullptr)` after `buses.resize(p_bus_layout->buses.size())` and adding a `nullptr` check before attempt to get the bus name in `AudioServer::get_bus_index`\n- Moving the `AudioDriver::get_singleton()->set_sample_bus_send` call to a separated for loop after the first loop ends\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77cd9bf9-9f77-4aee-bd0e-75d973d84bf8","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4586614529/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4587053692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-4587053692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":4587053692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEWjifA","user":{"login":"dragonforge-dev","id":172682465,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkrs4Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172682465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/dragonforge-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dragonforge-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-31T14:48:19Z","updated_at":"2026-05-31T14:48:19Z","body":"Tested in v4.7.beta4.official [dff2b9bb6] and could not reproduce the problem.\n\nAppears fixed.\n\nhttps://dragonforge-development.itch.io/audiobus-web-bug\n\n<img width=\"1908\" height=\"794\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13a31698-1dfa-4561-aac6-c560da462e61\" />\n\nDo you want me to close it? What's your process?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4587053692/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4587100029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-4587100029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115560","id":4587100029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEWmXfQ","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-31T15:06:43Z","updated_at":"2026-05-31T15:06:52Z","body":"> Do you want me to close it?\n\nLet's keep it open for now and wait some manteiner take a look on th