h debug features, before that PR `use_assertions` was normally usable, but it defaulted to `no`, after PR it now defaults to `yes`.\n\n~~I wonder if you can fix it locally for 4.5.stable and test the release template again without assertions.~~ Nevermind it's working in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115560#issuecomment-3834738108","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5058048252/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]